msgstr "Cesta přesměrování"

#: includes/Modules/SecurityOptimization/Module.php:607
msgid "Used with \"Custom path on this site\". A slug or path on the current domain, e.g. about-us or contact/address. The domain is added automatically, so the redirect keeps working after a domain move."
