#: build/index.63be5d1ed7f340a7e6d4.js:35
msgid "The wizard finds plugins on this site whose job a UX Studio module does as well."
msgstr "Průvodce na tomto webu najde pluginy, jejichž práci umí i modul UX Studia."

#: build/index.2c95a680c29b69c0fa18.js:18
msgid "It only reads the plugins. Nothing in them changes, and nothing is switched on or deactivated."
