msgid "UX Studio has been updated and the custom login address you set up earlier is now really in force.\n\nLog in here from now on:\n%1$s\n\nThe usual address (wp-login.php) no longer shows the login form. Save the new address in your password manager.\n\nIf you do not want this, switch it off in UX Studio > Security > Login:\n%2$s\n\nIf you cannot log in at all, add this line to wp-config.php and the old address works again:\ndefine( 'UXSTUDIO_DISABLE_LOGIN_LOCK', true );"
